e":12758,"digest":"sha256:7bb43bba25056a2c89a3ac726b0ee1279b41b0028b49f1494afd544190902c69","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-10-15T09:58:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T09:58:53Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/releases/download/3.33.0/litmus-without-resources.yaml"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litmuschaos/litmus/tarball/3.33.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litmuschaos/litmus/zipball/3.33.0","body":"## What's Changed\n* fix(subscriber): resolve adminModeNamespace for chaos engine probe check by @mimo-to in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5617\n* chore: fix the build pipeline by @Sonichigo in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5624\n* test: add unit test for ChaosHub output mapping by @Ju-Min-Kyung in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5549\n* test(chaoscenter): add unit tests for Loader component by @Shahazadi-Shaguftha-Syed in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5567\n* chore: fix fuzzing test ci due to protobuf conflict by @Sonichigo in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5632\n* use crypto/rand for the infra access key by @naruto-lgtm in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5633\n* fix(web): bump vulnerable transitive npm dependencies by @PriteshKiri in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5631\n* chore: go version bump and cve fixed by @Sonichigo in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5627\n* docs: fix broken links across adopter and translation READMEs by @ajmani-x in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5619\n* fix: scope invitation and leave project updates to the caller by @naruto-lgtm in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5600\n* fix(graphql-server): dispatch cron schedule updates to subscriber on experiment save by @pujitha24 in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5628\n* fix(chaoscenter): normalize timestamp precision in Duration component by @Shahazadi-Shaguftha-Syed in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5634\n* fix(chaoscenter): include the year when comparing date ranges by @ajmani-x in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5646\n* fix: stop GetProjectStats after the admin check fails by @naruto-lgtm in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5636\n* fix(manifests): move CUSTOM_TLS_CERT from subscriber config to subscriber secret  by @mimo-to in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5637\n* fix: sort experiments by name in the requested order by @Aryanbhargava18 in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5642\n* fix: return FindUsersByUID errors before using the result in GetProjectById by @Aryanbhargava18 in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5643\n* fix: keep the experiment manifest in git when deleting a single run by @Aryanbhargava18 in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5644\n* fix(gitops): prevent panic when syncing inline probes by @Calvinaud in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5615\n\n## New Contributors\n* @mimo-to made their first contribution in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5617\n* @Sonichigo made their first contribution in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5624\n* @Ju-Min-Kyung made their first contribution in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5549\n* @ajmani-x made their first contribution in https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/pull/5619\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/litmuschaos/litmus/compare/3.32.0...3.33.0","mentions_count":10}